        en: 'GIDS collects only the personal information reasonably needed to provide subscriptions, maintain security, diagnose errors, prevent abuse, record consent and audit events, and operate the website.',
        zh: 'GIDS 仅收集为提供订阅、维护安全、诊断错误、防止滥用、记录同意和审计事件、运营网站而合理需要的个人信息。',
      },
      {
        en: 'Subscription records may include email address, hashed email lookup values, preferences, locale, timezone, confirmation and unsubscribe tokens, delivery status, recipient domain, technical logs, user agent, and hashed or otherwise reduced IP metadata.',
        zh: '订阅记录可能包括邮箱地址、邮箱哈希查询值、偏好、语言、时区、确认与退订令牌、投递状态、收件域名、技术日志、用户代理，以及经过哈希或其他降维处理的 IP 元数据。',
      },
      {
        en: 'GIDS does not sell subscriber email addresses and does not use subscription addresses for targeted advertising. Service providers such as hosting, database, security, email, analytics, or repository platforms may process information only as needed to support the service.',
        zh: 'GIDS 不出售订阅者邮箱地址，也不将订阅邮箱用于定向广告。托管、数据库、安全、邮件、分析或代码托管等服务提供商可能仅在支持服务所需范围内处理信息。',
      },
      {
        en: 'Data may be processed in countries other than where you live. GIDS applies reasonable technical and organizational safeguards, but no internet service can guarantee absolute security.',
