    titleEn: '11. Local Storage, Cookies, and Security Controls',
    titleZh: '11. 本地存储、Cookie 与安全控制',
    paragraphs: [
      {
        en: 'The website may use local storage or similar browser features to remember language and theme preferences. These preferences are stored in your browser and can be cleared through browser settings.',
