      {
        en: 'If GIDS learns that it has collected subscription personal information from a child where parental consent or another lawful basis is required but not available, it may delete or disable the relevant subscription information.',
        zh: '如果 GIDS 发现已收集儿童订阅个人信息，而依法需要但无法取得父母同意或其他合法处理基础，GIDS 可删除或停用相关订阅信息。',
